{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/deeplearning/2_case/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>아래와 같은 모델을 예시로 보면서 공부한다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic Networks\n<ul>\n<li>LeNet-5</li>\n<li>AlexNet</li>\n<li>VGG-16</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>ResNet</li>\n<li>Inception</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Classic Networks</h2>\n<h3>LeNet-5</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>논문 작성 당시에는 ReLU를 사용하지 않는 분위기라 Sigmoid와 tanh만 사용함.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/a91f8/lenet5.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/a59e9/lenet5.webp 192w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/0ca9f/lenet5.webp 384w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/dc9b9/lenet5.webp 768w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/a6361/lenet5.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/3b721/lenet5.png 192w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/66595/lenet5.png 384w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/fe486/lenet5.png 768w,\n/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/a91f8/lenet5.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/5da784a2f1c4283a56334a83e6cd088f/fe486/lenet5.png\"\n            alt=\"LeNet-5\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>AlexNet</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>LeNet과 비슷하지만 더 커졌다. (6만개 파라메터 → 6천만개 파라매터)</li>\n<li>ReLU를 사용한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/a91f8/alexnet.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/a59e9/alexnet.webp 192w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/0ca9f/alexnet.webp 384w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/dc9b9/alexnet.webp 768w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/a6361/alexnet.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/3b721/alexnet.png 192w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/66595/alexnet.png 384w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/fe486/alexnet.png 768w,\n/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/a91f8/alexnet.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/df7d5079fc91f0011dfd005a8ac08e42/fe486/alexnet.png\"\n            alt=\"AlexNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>VGG-16</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>많은 파라메터를 갖고 있지만 더 간단한 네트워크를 사용해서 convolution layer에만 집중한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/a91f8/vcg16.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/a59e9/vcg16.webp 192w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/0ca9f/vcg16.webp 384w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/dc9b9/vcg16.webp 768w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/a6361/vcg16.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/3b721/vcg16.png 192w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/66595/vcg16.png 384w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/fe486/vcg16.png 768w,\n/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/a91f8/vcg16.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/d98becbbd17bf753b56aef5c07f51c94/fe486/vcg16.png\"\n            alt=\"VGG-16\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>ResNet</h2>\n<p>아주 깊은 신경망은 훈련시키기 어렵다. (기울기 소실, 폭발 유형의 문제)</p>\n<p>한 계층에서 activation을 가져와서 깊은 다른 계층으로 갑자기 전달할 수 있는 건너뛰기 연결을 배운다. 그리고 이를 이용해서 ResNet을 구축한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/a91f8/resnet_1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/a59e9/resnet_1.webp 192w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/0ca9f/resnet_1.webp 384w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/dc9b9/resnet_1.webp 768w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/a6361/resnet_1.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/3b721/resnet_1.png 192w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/66595/resnet_1.png 384w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/fe486/resnet_1.png 768w,\n/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/a91f8/resnet_1.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/c1f50ff6cf9a92f6e342691a7ad176f5/fe486/resnet_1.png\"\n            alt=\"ResNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>ResNet은 잔류블록이라는 것으로 만들어져있다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/a91f8/resnet_2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/a59e9/resnet_2.webp 192w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/0ca9f/resnet_2.webp 384w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/dc9b9/resnet_2.webp 768w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/a6361/resnet_2.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/3b721/resnet_2.png 192w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/66595/resnet_2.png 384w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/fe486/resnet_2.png 768w,\n/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/a91f8/resnet_2.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/e6c9a6304dd156bac2003c14553af6aa/fe486/resnet_2.png\"\n            alt=\"ResNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>위는 5개의 잔류블록으로 구성된 ResNet이다. 일반적으로 모델이 거대해질 수록 훈련의 효율이 떨어지는데, ResNet은 훈련 오류의 성능이 계속 낮아질 수 있다.</p>\n<p>ResNet은 왜 잘 작동할까?</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/a91f8/resnet_3.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/a59e9/resnet_3.webp 192w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/0ca9f/resnet_3.webp 384w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/dc9b9/resnet_3.webp 768w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/a6361/resnet_3.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/3b721/resnet_3.png 192w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/66595/resnet_3.png 384w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/fe486/resnet_3.png 768w,\n/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/a91f8/resnet_3.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/eedc2067ede046e327be187ee3558f15/fe486/resnet_3.png\"\n            alt=\"ResNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>a[l+2] = a[l]이라는 항등식이 도출되므로 잔류블록을 학습하기 쉽기 때문.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Networks in Networks and 1x1 Convolutions</h2>\n<p>1 x 1 컨볼루션을 왜 사용할까?</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/e6e97/1x1conv.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/a59e9/1x1conv.webp 192w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/0ca9f/1x1conv.webp 384w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/dc9b9/1x1conv.webp 768w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/97885/1x1conv.webp 864w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/3b721/1x1conv.png 192w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/66595/1x1conv.png 384w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/fe486/1x1conv.png 768w,\n/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/e6e97/1x1conv.png 864w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/59dd24ed1139e83d468736155b0c3607/fe486/1x1conv.png\"\n            alt=\"Networks in Networks and 1x1 Convolutions\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>input이 하나의 채널일 때에는 의미가  없다. 단순히 곱한 값이 된다. 하지만 채널이 여러개라면, 여러 채널에 대해 연산을 처리할 수 있다. network in network 라고 부른다.</p>\n<p>1 x 1 컨볼루션은 채널의 크기를 축소하거나 원하는 채널 수로 늘리거나 유지하는데 사용할 수 있다. 파라메터 수를 줄여서 계산량을 감소시킨다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Inception Network Motivation</h2>\n<p>특정 필터나 풀링을 선택하는 것이 아니라 여러 작업을 수행하고 출력을 연결하는 개념.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/e6e97/inception1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/a59e9/inception1.webp 192w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/0ca9f/inception1.webp 384w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/dc9b9/inception1.webp 768w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/97885/inception1.webp 864w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/3b721/inception1.png 192w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/66595/inception1.png 384w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/fe486/inception1.png 768w,\n/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/e6e97/inception1.png 864w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/fae7bbe6da33c6a9a7170115c14e7f46/fe486/inception1.png\"\n            alt=\"Inception Network Motivation\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>계산 비용에 문제가 있다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/e6e97/inception2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/a59e9/inception2.webp 192w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/0ca9f/inception2.webp 384w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/dc9b9/inception2.webp 768w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/97885/inception2.webp 864w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/3b721/inception2.png 192w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/66595/inception2.png 384w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/fe486/inception2.png 768w,\n/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/e6e97/inception2.png 864w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/870b8e8f375503b89c7b5ecd0b6203c5/fe486/inception2.png\"\n            alt=\"Inception Network Motivation\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>28 x 28 x 192 input을 5 x 5 same 32으로 CONV하여 28 x 28 x 32의 결과를 얻으려고 한다면, 계산 비용은 28 * 28 * 32 * 5 * 5 * 192 = 120M</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/e6e97/inception3.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/a59e9/inception3.webp 192w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/0ca9f/inception3.webp 384w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/dc9b9/inception3.webp 768w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/97885/inception3.webp 864w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/3b721/inception3.png 192w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/66595/inception3.png 384w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/fe486/inception3.png 768w,\n/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/e6e97/inception3.png 864w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/86b4285bacaa88dbf3df56312dc7dcd8/fe486/inception3.png\"\n            alt=\"Inception Network Motivation\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>중간에 1 x 1 CONV을 추가하면 계산 비용을 줄일 수 있다. 이를 병목현상 레이어라고 한다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>28 x 28 x 16 x 192 = 2.4M</li>\n<li>28 x 28 x 32 x 5 x 5 x 16 = 10.0M</li>\n<li>총 12.4M</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Inception Network</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/e6e97/inception4.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/a59e9/inception4.webp 192w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/0ca9f/inception4.webp 384w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/dc9b9/inception4.webp 768w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/97885/inception4.webp 864w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/3b721/inception4.png 192w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/66595/inception4.png 384w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/fe486/inception4.png 768w,\n/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/e6e97/inception4.png 864w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/57c71c0a99f760abd66fd294729c3ffb/fe486/inception4.png\"\n            alt=\"Inception Network\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>MobileNet</h2>\n<p>낮은 계산 환경에서도 작동하는 네트워크를 만들 수 있게 해준다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/a91f8/mobilenet1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/a59e9/mobilenet1.webp 192w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/0ca9f/mobilenet1.webp 384w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/dc9b9/mobilenet1.webp 768w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/a6361/mobilenet1.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/3b721/mobilenet1.png 192w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/66595/mobilenet1.png 384w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/fe486/mobilenet1.png 768w,\n/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/a91f8/mobilenet1.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/8eedfcd5cc103b3937315dc43f4519cf/fe486/mobilenet1.png\"\n            alt=\"MobileNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>Depthwise Convolution</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>6 x 6 x3 * 3 x 3 = 4 x 4 x 3</li>\n<li>총 계산량 = filter params(3 * 3 )* filter positions(4 * 4) * num of filters(3) = 432</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Pointwise Convolution</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>4 x 4 x 3 * 1 x 1 x 3 = 4 x 4</li>\n<li>nc` filter로 4 x 4 x 5</li>\n<li>총 계산량 = filter params(1 * 1 * 3) * filter positions(4 * 4) * num of filters(5) = 240</li>\n</ul>\n<p>그러므로,</p>\n<h3>Depthwise separable convolution</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>총 계산량 = 432 + 240 = 672</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Normal Convolution</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>총 계산량 = 2160</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/a91f8/mobilenet2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/a59e9/mobilenet2.webp 192w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/0ca9f/mobilenet2.webp 384w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/dc9b9/mobilenet2.webp 768w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/a6361/mobilenet2.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/3b721/mobilenet2.png 192w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/66595/mobilenet2.png 384w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/fe486/mobilenet2.png 768w,\n/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/a91f8/mobilenet2.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/83172dbc4ea80d086071ee5febc354ef/fe486/mobilenet2.png\"\n            alt=\"MobileNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/a91f8/mobilenetv2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/a59e9/mobilenetv2.webp 192w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/0ca9f/mobilenetv2.webp 384w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/dc9b9/mobilenetv2.webp 768w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/a6361/mobilenetv2.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/3b721/mobilenetv2.png 192w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/66595/mobilenetv2.png 384w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/fe486/mobilenetv2.png 768w,\n/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/a91f8/mobilenetv2.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/ff736862ea8bd8f31af444ad65b67d77/fe486/mobilenetv2.png\"\n            alt=\"MobileNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>EfficientNet</h2>\n<p>특정 장치의 신경망을 자동으로 확장하거나 축소하는 기능을 제공함.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/a91f8/efficientnet.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/a59e9/efficientnet.webp 192w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/0ca9f/efficientnet.webp 384w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/dc9b9/efficientnet.webp 768w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/a6361/efficientnet.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/3b721/efficientnet.png 192w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/66595/efficientnet.png 384w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/fe486/efficientnet.png 768w,\n/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/a91f8/efficientnet.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/fc55e91a779211abf2c1565587ce6fe8/fe486/efficientnet.png\"\n            alt=\"EfficientNet\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>참고 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/convolutional-neural-networks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coursera - Convolution Neural Networks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hwiyong.tistory.com/45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1x1 convolution이란,</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://velog.io/@lighthouse97/ResNet%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%ED%95%B4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResNet의 이해</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://techblog-history-younghunjo1.tistory.com/132\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ML] ResNet &#x26; Inception Network란?</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"DeepLearning - CNN Case Studies","date":"2024.06.27.","categories":["DeepLearning"]}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/deeplearning/2_case/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}